JoinSlug:

```go
// JoinSlug 把多段文本分别转成 slug，用 "/" 连接，跳过空白段。
func JoinSlug(parts ...string) string {
	slugs := make([]string, 0, len(parts))
	for _, p := range parts {
		if s := Slug(p); s != "" {
			slugs = append(slugs, s)
		}
	}
	return strings.Join(slugs, "/")
}
```

Acceptance: JoinSlug("Hello World","Big Day") → "hello-world/big-day"; JoinSlug("a","","b") → "a/b". Also pure whitespace skipped — the condition title says "空串与纯空白被跳过" but example only shows "". Slug("   ") == "" so covered; I'll include a whitespace case in the test to match the stated condition.

